        "message": "=<h2>New Customer Support Ticket</h2>\n\n<p><strong>Department:</strong>{{ $('ClassifyCategoryAndUrgency').item.json.output.category }}</p>\n<p><strong>Urgency:</strong> {{ $('ClassifyCategoryAndUrgency').item.json.output.urgency }}</p>\n\n<hr>\n\n<p><strong>From:</strong> {{ $('FormatEmailData').item.json.sender.replace(/&/g, '&amp;').replace(/</g, '&lt;').replace(/>/g, '&gt;') }}</p>\n<p><strong>Received:</strong> {{ DateTime.fromISO($('FormatEmailData').item.json.received_at).toUTC().toFormat('d MMM yyyy, h:mm a') }} UTC</p>\n<p><strong>Subject:</strong> {{ $('FormatEmailData').item.json.subject}}</p>\n\n<h3>Customer Message</h3>\n\n<p>{{ $('FormatEmailData').item.json.body}}</p>\n\n<hr>\n\n<p><em>Automatically classified by the Customer Support Ticket Triage workflow.</em></p>",
